@startuml
title FR-02 - Register Hospital - Activity Diagram

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam conditionStyle InsideDiamond

|Network Administrator|
start
:Request registration of a hospital;

|Client|
:Display the required registration fields;

|Network Administrator|
:Enter hospital details, location,\nand approved contact information;

if (Cancel registration\nbefore saving?) then ([Yes])
  :Cancel registration;
  stop

else ([No])
  :Click the submit button;

  |Server — Organizations|
  :Validate the hospital data;

  if (Data valid\nand complete?) then ([Yes])
    :Save the hospital record;

    |Client|
    :Display registration confirmation;
    stop

  else ([No])
    |Client|
    :Request correction of missing\nor invalid fields;
    stop
  endif
endif

@enduml